    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wandu kulomba Jeremia uwilombie",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko wabaa wose wa majeshi, na Johanani mwana wa Karea, na Azaria mwana wa Hoshaia, na wandu wose kufuma mtini hata m'baa wikasoghoda kaavui ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wikanizera, “Dakulomba kudibonyere seji dikuzeragha, nao kumlombe BWANA Mlungu wako kwa wundu ghodu, ee kwa wundu ghwa agha masighariko ghose gha wandu (kwa kukaia isi derekoghe wengi deechasigharika watinieri seji kudiwonagha); ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eri BWANA Mlungu wako upate kudiwonyera chia ifwanagha diinughe, na agho ghidifwanagha kubonya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nani ngawizera, “Namsikira; olenyi nichamlomba BWANA Mlungu onyu sa iji koni mwanilomba, na agho ghose BWANA uchaanitumbulia, nichamghoria; sichaamvisa ilagho jingi anduangi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao wikanizera, “BWANA ndekaie mshahidi wa loli na wa hachi aighu yedu, iji dalemwa ni kubonya malagho agho ghose BWANA Mlungu wako uchaakuduma kodu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichalusikira lwaka lwa BWANA, uo dakuduma kwake ikaiagha ni kwa mawiwi angu kwa mecha, dipate mecha iji damsikira BWANA Mlungu odu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Matumbulio gha BWANA kwa malombi gha Jeremia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuma ya matuku ikumi, BWANA ukaghora nani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko ngammbanga Johanani mwana wa Karea na wabaa wose wa majeshi werekwanyeghe, na wandu wose kufuma mtini wawo hata m'baa wawo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngawizera, “BWANA, uo Mlungu wa Israeli, uo morenidumieghe nighenje malombi ghenyu kwake waghamba huwu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Iji mwakaia andenyi ya iji isanga, niko nichammangisha hata sichaamvuchua anduangi. Nichammbika aeni hata sichaamuinja anduangi; kwa kukaia nawawa ni agho mawiwi nim'bonyere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Msakemuobua uo mzuri wa Babuloni, uo mwawuyamuobua; msemuobuo, angu ini neko andwamweri na inyo, nipate kumkira na kumvuvua kufuma mikonunyi kwake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nichammbonia inyo wughoma eri upate kummbonia wughoma, na kumsigha mkaie andenyi ya isanga jenyu jeni.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ela mkaghamba, ‘Isi ndedichaakaia andenyi ya iji isanga’, nao mleghe kumsikira BWANA Mlungu onyu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwa kughamba, ‘Hata! Isi dichaghenda cha isanga ja Misri, andu disechaawona wuda, angu kusikira lwaka lwa tarumbeta, angu kusowa vindo; nesi dichakaia aho,’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sikirenyi seji BWANA wa majeshi, uo Mlungu wa Israeli waghora huwu inyo masighariko gha Juda, ‘Mkafunga ndighi kughenda cha Misri mwendekaia aho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "niko aho ugho wuda mwawuyaghuobua ghuchaamchea ahoeni isanga ja Misri, na iyo njala mwawuyaiobua ichamchea kwa wungi ahoeni Misri, nenyo mchafuya aho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wose wichaakufunya kwendakaia Misri, wichabwaghwa wudenyi, na kwa njala, na kwa saka izamie; ndekuchaakaia na masighariko ghangi angu mndungi okaia moyo kufumanya na ugho wuwiwi nichaawiredia.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“BWANA wa majeshi, uo Mlungu wa Israeli waghamba huwu: ‘Sa iji koni machu ghapo na kubia kwapo korediriloghe aighu ya wandu werekoghe Jerusalemu, niko koni na machu ghapo ghichaadilwa konyu iji mwaghenda cha Misri. Mchawuya sa vilambo va kisha, wandu weshinikilwa, wandu wa njowe, na wandu wesekwa. Ndemchaajiwona iji isanga sena.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“BWANA wamzera huwu ee masighariko gha Juda, ‘Mseghende Misri.’ Manyenyi kukaia namghoria idime iji ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kukaia, mwakulaghashire nenyo mchakubwagha mmbeni. Morenidumieghe kwa BWANA Mlungu onyu, mkighamba, ‘Dilombie kwa BWANA Mlungu odu, na ijo jose kuchaazerwa ni BWANA Mlungu odu, nijo jeni dichaabonya.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nani namghoria idime, ela ndemumsikire BWANA Mlungu onyu kwa jingi ja agho unidumie nimghorie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo manyenyi loli angu mchabwaghwa wudenyi, na kwa njala, na kwa saka izamie, andenyi ya ijo isanga mwawuyakaia na bea eghendajikaia.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
